            <Title>VM Tools outdated</Title>
                        
            <Description>Count of VMs with VMware Tools not current. Tools are part of vSphere best practices as it provides a set of drivers and improve visibility.

A blank status means the VMware Tools are not even installed.
</Description>
                        
